    ["Did you hear about the strange thing that happened in the Church District last week?"] = "Вы слышали о странной вещи, произошедшей в Церковном округе на прошлой неделе?",
    ["Next Acting Level unlock time: <Yellow>%s</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Cognitive Experience Acquisition</>\nSufficient cognition is beneficial for the advancement of Acting. Completing main quests, side quests, Era and Roaming quests, and participating in various daily activities (including <Yellow>Easy Wins, War-Driven Growth, World Adventure</>, etc.) will grant a large amount of Cognitive Experience. When you relive the history of Mr. Fool, influenced by the power of \"Grafting,\" you can also obtain your own share of Cognitive Experience. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Level Limit Rules</>\nWhen a Beyonder's Acting Level reaches the current cap and Cognitive Experience is full, you will no longer be able to gain Cognitive Experience until a new Acting Level limit is opened. After the Acting Level reaches the final cap, accumulated Cognitive Experience will be used to unlock Divinity Level—cognition beyond the limit makes humanity increasingly faint, bringing you closer to God. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Humanity and Divinity in Acting</>\n\"All things have divinity; when Acting exceeds the limit, you will gradually move toward the original divinity.\"\nBeyonders continuously accept cognition about this world through daily experiences, quests, and exploration, converting it into <Yellow>Cognitive Experience</>. Accumulating Cognitive Experience can gradually improve your <Yellow>Acting Level</>, consolidating the stability of your spirit and existence through Acting. \nHowever, cognition and Acting themselves contain risks, and every step of Acting comes with a price. When the Acting Level reaches the final cap, humanity will be unable to maintain the influence brought by Acting—subsequent Acting will begin to shape divinity. Beyonders will gradually move toward divinity during Acting, thereby increasing their <Yellow>Divinity Level</>. \nTo prevent mental collapse from receiving excessive cognition in a short period, you have been granted a protective blessing by Mr. Fool that limits your level. At the current Acting Level or Divinity Level, your body and spirit must undergo sufficient adaptation and precipitation before you can break through the level limit, withstand higher levels of cognition, and move to the next stage."] = "Next Acting Level unlock time: <Yellow>%s</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Cognitive Experience Acquisition</>\nSufficient cognition is beneficial for the advancement of Acting. Completing main quests, side quests, Era and Roaming quests, and participating in various daily activities (including <Yellow>Easy Wins, War-Driven Growth, World Adventure</>, etc.) will grant a large amount of Cognitive Experience. When you relive the history of Mr. Fool, influenced by the power of \"Grafting,\" you can also obtain your own share of Cognitive Experience. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Level Limit Rules</>\nWhen a Потусторонний's Acting Level reaches the current cap and Cognitive Experience is full, you will no longer be able to gain Cognitive Experience until a new Acting Level limit is opened. After the Acting Level reaches the final cap, accumulated Cognitive Experience will be used to unlock Divinity Level—cognition beyond the limit makes humanity increasingly faint, bringing you closer to God. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Humanity and Divinity in Acting</>\n\"All things have divinity; when Acting exceeds the limit, you will gradually move toward the original divinity.\"\nПотустороннийs continuously accept cognition about this world through daily experiences, quests, and exploration, converting it into <Yellow>Cognitive Experience</>. Accumulating Cognitive Experience can gradually improve your <Yellow>Acting Level</>, consolidating the stability of your spirit and existence through Acting. \nHowever, cognition and Acting themselves contain risks, and every step of Acting comes with a price. When the Acting Level reaches the final cap, humanity will be unable to maintain the influence brought by Acting—subsequent Acting will begin to shape divinity. Потустороннийs will gradually move toward divinity during Acting, thereby increasing their <Yellow>Divinity Level</>. \nTo prevent mental collapse from receiving excessive cognition in a short period, you have been granted a protective blessing by Mr. Fool that limits your level. At the current Acting Level or Divinity Level, your body and spirit must undergo sufficient adaptation and precipitation before you can break through the level limit, withstand higher levels of cognition, and move to the next stage.",
    ["No, this is not rebirth"] = "Нет, это не возрождение",
